      <activity id="ed4526cc-2bcd-574b-8af1-9a11d6451eae" activityNameId="5ae6bab0-9316-508f-a579-8501a31c3a5c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Acetic acid from acetaldehyde, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Acetic acid from acetaldehyde, at plant
The multioutput-process "acetaldehyde oxidation process" delivers the co-products acetic anhydride from acetyaldehyde and acetic acid from acetaldehyde. The allocation is based on mass balance.;
UUID: c8788f81-09da-34fb-bf49-8d26c3218840
Oxidation acetaldehyde including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Oxidation of acetaldehyde
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports and emissions are modelled with standard methods.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c8788f81-09da-34fb-bf49-8d26c3218840.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
